28
00:02:49,758 --> 00:02:50,579
[SPEAKER_03]: How would you describe it?

29
00:02:51,179 --> 00:02:53,081
[SPEAKER_03]: So, it's just something that you can actually practice.

30
00:02:54,482 --> 00:03:01,447
