[SPEAKER_03]: So, you're taking yourself as not yourself.

34
00:03:08,312 --> 00:03:08,933
[SPEAKER_03]: Not as mine.

35
00:03:09,413 --> 00:03:10,614
[SPEAKER_03]: Not as yours.

36
00:03:10,654 --> 00:03:18,040
[SPEAKER_03]: So, the entirety of your sense of self, of your experience as a whole, you turn against and say, I won't take this as mine.

37
