38
00:03:42,446 --> 00:03:42,806
[SPEAKER_03]: What else?

39
00:03:43,086 --> 00:03:43,486
[SPEAKER_03]: How else?

40
00:03:44,247 --> 00:03:48,288
[SPEAKER_03]: What other characteristics of that would you single out?

41
00:03:49,821 --> 00:03:57,486
[SPEAKER_03]: To not take the significance of whatever, of things, for granted, basically.

42
