[SPEAKER_03]: They fuel personality and they maintain it.

77
00:07:53,852 --> 00:08:09,059
[SPEAKER_03]: So, even if you are saying to yourself, in the meantime, and trying to genuinely, like, honestly, practice the attitude of not taking things personally, if you're still acting out of those reasons, that is your personality.

78
