[SPEAKER_03]: And that's why the mind will not listen, so to speak.

79
00:08:13,641 --> 00:08:17,783
[SPEAKER_03]: But, if you were to purify your behavior, that which you already know,

80
00:08:18,862 --> 00:08:19,462
