81
00:08:20,523 --> 00:08:22,404
[SPEAKER_03]: As I said, like, colloquially.

82
00:08:22,864 --> 00:08:23,985
[SPEAKER_03]: Oh, don't take it personally.

83
00:08:24,025 --> 00:08:25,085
[SPEAKER_03]: I found that very useful.

84
00:08:25,105 --> 00:08:25,686
[SPEAKER_03]: You should try it.

